==Battleground==
*30 [[Croco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s (300%) spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*15 [[Squire Rel]]s (300%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Festival Sign Girl]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**5 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**4 [[Vendor El]]s spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to win.

